  "docs_rpc_md_option_details_delta": "Adds only the documented optional `optionDetails: Array<{ description?: string }>` for `select`, aligned to `options: string[]`; hosts that do not render descriptions keep using `options` alone.",
  "hop_classification": {
    "17.4.0->17.4.1": {
      "mapped_files": [
        "src/modes/rpc/rpc-mode.ts"
      ],
      "classification": "unmapped additive/advisory",
      "reason": "rpc-mode.ts adds the host `runCommandInBackground` callback and reports the consumed-builtin `prompt` response field `agentInvoked` accurately. Swallowtail reads only response `success` for `prompt`, never registers host extension callbacks, and no mapped flag, command, frame, response key, event, or UI field moves."
    },
    "17.4.1->17.4.2": {
      "mapped_files": [
        "src/modes/rpc/rpc-mode.ts",
        "src/modes/rpc/rpc-types.ts"
      ],
      "classification": "unmapped additive optional select metadata",
      "reason": "Optional `optionDetails` is added to the `select` extension_ui_request and `requestRpcSelect` is extracted; docs/rpc.md at v17.4.2 states hosts that do not render descriptions continue to use `options` alone. Swallowtail keeps reading the `options` string array and bounds unknown select fields. `options` remains the positionally aligned label array."
    },
    "17.4.2->18.0.0": {
